        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: North American CD release of \"She's a Machine\", \"Bring It (Snakes on a Plane)\"\n- People: the guest vocalist on \"Bring It (Snakes on a Plane)\", Sev Lewkowicz\n- Roles: lead singers\n\nFacts:\n- The North American CD release of \"She's a Machine\" removed the guest vocals from the song \"Bring It (Snakes on a Plane)\".\n- The removed guest vocalist is an artist who has played and recorded with Sev Lewkowicz.\n- The removed guest vocalist and the other vocalist mentioned in the chunk are both lead singers.",
